Error [E0128]: `UserID(value)` is not a distinct conversion
  --> tests/ui/distinct_constructor_alias.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     id :: UserID(1)
    |           ^^^^^^
 Why: Explicit conversions are owned by the destination type and name their source
 Fix: Write `UserID.from_int(value)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0128
